{
  "name": "worn-to-zero",
  "description": "Item 034’s third wear fixture, on the Grinder since item 145 deleted the Chip Kitchen it used to run on. Opens with klapaucius (the flavour-line precedent), buys kola nuts, and grinds the machine from full condition to zero by honest work — jams whacked out on the way down (19), never repaired — until it halts and sits dead for 300 ticks losing nothing further, then is restored to full by free hand repair alone (plan §1: \"manual never rots\"). The feed is steered so the hopper runs dry exactly at zero, so the fixture ends restored, idle, and at full condition. Re-recorded 2026-08-27; see scripts/record-worn-to-zero.ts.",
